            "Yes, because Defendant intentionally burned and charred structural timber of the building with malice.",
            "Yes, under the doctrine of transferred intent, because burning personal property inside a building constitutes arson.",
            "No, because common law arson is strictly limited to the burning of a dwelling house of another.",
